#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:2
msgid "Exposure Control Code Samples"
msgstr "露出制御コードサンプル"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:4
msgid ""
"Import the interface. This line is automatically added by OnBot Java when "
"the interface is used (coded)."
msgstr "インターフェースをインポートします。この行は、インターフェースが使用されるときにOnBot Javaによって自動的に追加されます。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:7
msgid ""
"``import "
"org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls.ExposureControl;``"
msgstr ""
"``import "
"org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls.ExposureControl;``"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:9
msgid "Declare the ExposureControl object, before ``runOpMode()``."
msgstr "``runOpMode()`` の前に、ExposureControlオブジェクトを宣言します。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:11
msgid "``ExposureControl myExposureControl;``"
msgstr "``ExposureControl myExposureControl;``"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:13
msgid ""
"Assign the Vuforia/TFOD video stream control to your control object, in "
"``runOpMode()``."
msgstr "``runOpMode()`` において、Vuforia/TFOD ビデオストリーム制御を制御オブジェクトに割り当てます。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:16
msgid ""
"``myExposureControl = "
"vuforia.getCamera().getControl(ExposureControl.class);``"
msgstr ""
"``myExposureControl = "
"vuforia.getCamera().getControl(ExposureControl.class);``"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:18
msgid "Set the mode to Manual, for direct control."
msgstr "モードをマニュアルに設定し、直接制御を行います。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:20
msgid "``myExposureControl.setMode(ExposureControl.Mode.Manual);``"
msgstr "``myExposureControl.setMode(ExposureControl.Mode.Manual);``"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:22
msgid "Set the exposure duration, in this case to 30 milliseconds."
msgstr "露出時間を設定します。この場合は30ミリ秒です。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:24
msgid "``myExposureControl.setExposure(30, TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS);``"
msgstr "``myExposureControl.setExposure(30, TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS);``"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/samples/samples.rst:26
msgid ""
"See far below for these and other exposure controls illustrated in `Sample "
"OpModes <#sample-opmodes>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Sample OpModes <#sample-opmodes>`__に示されているこれらおよびその他の露出制御については、下にご覧ください。"
